  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116162",
      "title": "Using Signals for Sharing Data Across Components (with OnPush)",
      "lectureOrder": 202,
      "videoOrder": 194,
      "sourceHash": "79588e53d6a40e5d16822b9928fc8b0dc9d407592ef00962201e9962731a8713",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 3.66,
          "en": "To show you how you could run into problems",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.66,
          "end": 6.87,
          "en": "when working with OnPush and services,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.87,
          "end": 10.11,
          "en": "I prepared a service for you, which you find attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.11,
          "end": 13.89,
          "en": "This messages.service.ts file is attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.89,
          "end": 16.983,
          "en": "and you should store it next to the messages.component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.6,
          "end": 21.69,
          "en": "In there, I'm, at the moment, managing a signal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.69,
          "end": 24.18,
          "en": "which manages my array of strings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.18,
          "end": 26.88,
          "en": "and I have this simple add message method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.88,
          "end": 30.93,
          "en": "to change that array, and then I provide access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.93,
          "end": 33.813,
          "en": "to all my messages in a read-only mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.85,
          "end": 39.51,
          "en": "Now, in the new-message.component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.51,
          "end": 43.83,
          "en": "we can inject that service to trigger its add message method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.83,
          "end": 46.053,
          "en": "whenever a new message is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.07,
          "end": 49.71,
          "en": "So instead of having an output here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.71,
          "end": 54.36,
          "en": "I'll add my messagesService here by injecting it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.36,
          "end": 56.703,
          "en": "with the inject function, in my case here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.673,
          "end": 61.2,
          "en": "messagesService, like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.2,
          "end": 64.02,
          "en": "and, of course, for that, both the service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.02,
          "end": 66.87,
          "en": "as well as the inject function must be imported,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.87,
          "end": 69.693,
          "en": "whereas the output function is not needed anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.06,
          "end": 77.06,
          "en": "and in the new-message.component class in onSubmit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.25,
          "end": 80.58,
          "en": "I, therefore, won't emit my entered text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 80.58,
          "end": 81.99,
          "en": "as an event anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.99,
          "end": 84.18,
          "en": "Instead, I'll use this messagesService",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.18,
          "end": 86.1,
          "en": "to call the add message method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.1,
          "end": 88.953,
          "en": "and pass my entered text to it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.71000000000001,
          "end": 94.41,
          "en": "Now, in the messages.component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.41,
          "end": 97.68,
          "en": "I no longer want to listen to this add event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.68,
          "end": 100.38300000000001,
          "en": "because it's not going to get emitted anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.55,
          "end": 105.093,
          "en": "and I no longer want to manage my messages in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 106.05,
          "end": 108.36,
          "en": "So I'll delete this messages signal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 108.36,
          "end": 110.07300000000001,
          "en": "from the messages.component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111,
          "end": 113.85,
          "en": "and get rid of the onAddMessage method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.85,
          "end": 117.333,
          "en": "because we're now managing those messages in that service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 118.53,
          "end": 121.053,
          "en": "Therefore, we can also remove the signal import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.21,
          "end": 125.46,
          "en": "In the messages.component HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 125.46,
          "end": 128.793,
          "en": "we should, therefore, remove this messages property binding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 132.9,
          "en": "and in the app-messages-list component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 132.9,
          "end": 135.93,
          "en": "I wanna remove this input, therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.93,
          "end": 139.47,
          "en": "and remove the import of the input function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 139.47,
          "end": 142.77,
          "en": "because, here, we're now also going to use that service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 142.77,
          "end": 144.633,
          "en": "to get hold of those messages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.74,
          "end": 147.81,
          "en": "with help of the inject function again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.81,
          "end": 151.113,
          "en": "in my case here, like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.73,
          "end": 155.253,
          "en": "importing the service, importing inject,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 156.09,
          "end": 160.44,
          "en": "and then I'll add a public property here, messages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 160.44,
          "end": 164.793,
          "en": "which is this MessagesService.allMessages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 165.84,
          "end": 168.63,
          "en": "and that gives me that read-only signal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 168.63,
          "end": 170.22,
          "en": "I'm not reading it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 170.22,
          "end": 171.54,
          "en": "I don't have parentheses here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.54,
          "end": 174.32999999999998,
          "en": "I'm just pointing at it so that it's the signal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.32999999999998,
          "end": 176.85,
          "en": "that's stored in this property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.85,
          "end": 179.97,
          "en": "because that then allows me to go to the template here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.97,
          "end": 183.36,
          "en": "and read that as a signal, as I did before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 183.36,
          "end": 185.763,
          "en": "but, now, it's the messages from the service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.96,
          "end": 190.2,
          "en": "It's also important that messages-list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 190.2,
          "end": 192.15,
          "en": "is a OnPush component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 192.15,
          "end": 196.203,
          "en": "and new-message is an OnPush component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.1,
          "end": 200.16,
          "en": "and the messages-component also is OnPush here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.16,
          "end": 203.37,
          "en": "in this case, though that actually doesn't matter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 203.37,
          "end": 207.66,
          "en": "but with this setup, we would now have a problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 207.66,
          "end": 211.35,
          "en": "if we would not use signals, as you'll see in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 211.35,
          "end": 213.69,
          "en": "Here, however, I am using signals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.69,
          "end": 216.72,
          "en": "and, therefore, here, everything will work as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 216.72,
          "end": 220.56,
          "en": "if we reload, and we wait for these counters to expire",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 220.56,
          "end": 222.57,
          "en": "so that we have a clear log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 222.57,
          "end": 225.963,
          "en": "If I enter something here, testing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 228.03,
          "end": 231.9,
          "en": "if I save this, you see the message shows up here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 231.9,
          "end": 234.9,
          "en": "and we get the same kind of logs as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 234.9,
          "end": 239.88,
          "en": "So that all works just as before without any changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 239.88,
          "end": 243.36,
          "en": "but, now, let's migrate from this signal based service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 243.36,
          "end": 247.74,
          "en": "to a non-signal based service with those OnPush components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 247.74,
          "end": 249.723,
          "en": "because that will give us a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
